      "content": "where $ \\sigma_{A_{1}}^{2} $ and $ \\sigma_{A_{2}}^{2} $ are the additive genetic variances in the $ P_{1} $ and $ P_{2} $ lines. The genotypic variance in the $ F_{1} $ generation follows from the fact that, for each locus,",
