      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "$ F_{1} $ individuals contain exactly one $ P_{1} $ allele and one $ P_{2} $ allele, and that the two haploid sets of alleles contribute variance $ \\sigma_{A_{1}}^{2}/2 $ and $ \\sigma_{A_{2}}^{2}/2 $.",
