          553.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "522a2f6682151d1f4cd430e48b143779e4035fc91423afba9a7d2a0e127172a8"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Since V is diagonal with $ V_{ii} = 2 \\sigma_{j}^{4}/(n_{j} + 2) $, Equation A3.11a gives the $ \\chi^{2} $ statistic for goodness of fit of the observed variances to the predictions of the additive model as",
      "source_page": 245,
      "printed_page": 225,
